WEBVTT

00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:01.526
He said, "It's a what?"

00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:03.120
I thought maybe I'd pronounced it wrong.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:07.195
"It's a Bacchanal by Titian."

00:01:07.195 --> 00:01:09.918
He said, "It's a what?"

00:01:09.918 --> 00:01:13.002
I said, "It's a Bacchanal by Titian." (Laughter)

00:01:13.002 --> 00:01:16.347
He said, "You boneless bookworm!

00:01:16.347 --> 00:01:18.890
It's a fucking orgy!"

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.961
(Laughter)

00:01:21.961 --> 00:01:24.313
As I said, he swore too much.

00:01:24.313 --> 00:01:27.845
There was an important lesson for me in that.

00:01:27.845 --> 00:01:31.673
Pietro was suspicious of formal art training,